  <li><a href="https://amzn.to/3CkIvXm" target="_blank" rel="nofollow sponsored noopener"><strong>Yanni</strong></a>: A Greek composer and pianist famous for incorporating keyboards and full orchestral arrangements into massive live performances.</li>
  <li><a href="https://amzn.to/3PKZnK0" target="_blank" rel="nofollow sponsored noopener"><strong>George Winston</strong></a>: A celebrated solo pianist known for his minimalist, melodic acoustic piano recordings.</li>
